<title>UK: Harry Ramsden raises 1.5 mln stg in placing.</title>
<headline>Harry Ramsden raises 1.5 mln stg in placing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British fish and chip chain Harry Ramsden's Plc said on Thursday it had raised 1.5 million stg from a placing of 441,115 new shares at 344p each to fund the company's restaurant opening programme.</p>
<p>The company said it expected to open 10 new restaurants this year. It already operates 21 restaurants in Britain and abroad.</p>
<p>Harry Ramsden's said the shares were being taken up by existing and new institutional shareholders.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
